    "text": "If the coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>15</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>15</mn></msup></math> is equal to the coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></msup></math> in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>15</mn></msup></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> are positive real numbers, then for each such ordered pair <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>:"
